{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55595","headline":"句 · 钱元瓘","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别泪已多红蜡泪，离盃须满绿荷盃。\n（《两浙金石志》卷四和凝《大晋故天下兵马都元帅守尚书令吴越国王諡文穆钱公神道碑》引。\n）（〖1〗《钱公神道碑》：「天福六年，王以弟兄归任，丝竹张筵，因抒嘉篇，久吟警句。\n〖诗略〗诗罢酒阑，情伤疾作。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱元瓘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}